00:53:05.740 --> 00:53:22.340
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder Mr. Torey Malatia, who asked me to tell you he can kick the ass of anybody in Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, the Bronx--

00:53:22.340 --> 00:53:29.570
<v Jorge Just>And this is something that people in New York have never, ever, ever, ever, ever, ever, ever believed.

00:53:29.570 --> 00:53:34.570
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
